TEXT 56 96 Left 2 ;Project 4:\nUsing only resistors, capacitors, and NMOS (2N7002)\nAchieve a gain of 50V/V, centered around 0.\n \nRules:\n- Resistors must be below 1Meg\n- No RF Chokes\n- Output must be centered around zero\n- NMOS cannot break (Power exceed datasheet limits)\n- Do not move anything inside of this box\n- Place your r-number at "RNUM"\n \nPlace "VIN" at the start of your amplifier, and\n"VOUT" at the end. You may use multiple stages.
